Did you give them eternal rest? Thank you very much.
Did they find Zarad? What great news. He will be happy to know we found his mother.
Yagditha sent him to the Sanctuary of the Abyss? But Midranda surrounded the Sanctuary with a barrier. Who would have thought Zarad would escape from there with the help of Deykoon, who had summoned Midranda's Specter on the Shadow Road.

The Shogoth regained consciousness and helped in the battle?
But it is only for a moment, before the soul leaves the body.
That is their way of helping us and saying goodbye to their friends.
It must have been sad to watch them fall one by one.
I will study these souls. Come back in a while.

